= 2.0.0 (2026-10-09)

* [SECURITY] Verify server certificate and hostname by default when using use_ssl with net/ldap backend (jeremyevans) (#9)

* Support setting use_ssl to a hash of TLS options (jeremyevans) (#9)

* Add single_threaded setting, for reusing a single connection object (jeremyevans)

* [SECURITY] Make valid? thread-safe by using a separate connection object per call by default (jeremyevans) (#8)

= 1.3.0 (2026-10-06)

* Log the LDAP diagnostic message on authentication failure (wuarmin) (#5, #6)

= 1.2.0 (2024-09-16)

* Do not require load_ldap_library be called before use of valid? (jeremyevans) (#3)

* [SECURITY] Explicitly check for null bytes in login and password in valid? (jeremyevans)

= 1.1.0 (2022-07-19)

* Make fallback to net/ldap work if ldap is not installed (jeremyevans)

* Make default servers, use_ssl, and login_format settings apply (jeremyevans)

* Work with newer net/ldap versions that use Net::LDAP::Error for errors (jeremyevans)

* Avoid verbose mode warnings (jeremyevans)

= 1.0.1 (2011-08-03)

* [SECURITY] Fix issue where an empty password would be accepted as a valid anonymous bind (jeremyevans)

= 1.0.0 (2006-08-25)

* Initial public release
